        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: વિમાસણ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "વિમાસણ — vimāsaṇ — \"a quandary\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જો તમે વિમાસણમાં પડશો તો મને ફોન કરો. jo tame vimāsaṇmā̃ paḍśo to mane phon karo. If you find yourself in a quandary, phone me."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "વિમાસણ (vimāsaṇ) is being caught between choices and uneasy about what will come; one \"falls\" into it: વિમાસણમાં પડવું. CDIAL lists the Gujarati word, with the sense \"fearful anticipation\", under Sanskrit vimarśana, \"investigation\" (CDIAL 11820)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
            }
          ]
        },
